        "original_id": "1d2867ac-77df-5f26-9c2e-9a6703e3a34a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sayidaty, Closer, Hia, Al Jamila, Reveal, Bella, Take a Break\n- People: Mai Badr\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- Places: Dubai, Beirut, Middle East, North Africa, Europe, America\n- Topics: women's magazines, tabloid newspapers\n\nFacts:\n- Sayidaty is a women's magazine whose Arabic edition is weekly and whose English edition is monthly.\n- Sayidaty is published in Dubai and Beirut and distributed throughout the Middle East, North Africa, Europe, and America.\n- Closer is a British tabloid magazine published by Bauer Media Group.\n- Mai Badr was born on 6 July 1968.\n- Mai Badr is the editor-in-chief of Hia and the deputy editor-in-chief of Sayidaty and Al Jamila.\n- Talk to the Press articles predominantly appear in tabloid newspapers including The Daily Mail, The Sun, and The Daily Mirror, and in women's magazines including Closer, Reveal, Bella, and Take a Break.",
